    "_P5_title": "SETUP Section 5: Type Aliases — Structure",
    "_P5_brief": "Format-agnostic structure definition. What Type Aliases IS, not how it manifests in any language. See format/blocks/{lang}/setup/type-aliases.jsonc for language-specific content.",

    // ===================================================================
    // CONTENT BLOCK [CONTENT]
